      "question": "<p><strong>[अधिकृत MSCE PUP 2026 Set A]</strong> (3x + 4y)² + (3x - 4y)² = ?<br><em>((3x + 4y)² + (3x − 4y)² = ?)</em></p>",
      "question_text": "<p><strong>[अधिकृत MSCE PUP 2026 Set A]</strong> (3x + 4y)² + (3x - 4y)² = ?<br><em>((3x + 4y)² + (3x − 4y)² = ?)</em></p>",
