      "question": "<p><strong>[अधिकृत MSCE PUP 2026 Set A]</strong> जर <sup>(4x + 10)</sup>/<sub>5</sub> = 6 तर x = ?<br><em>(If (4x + 10) / 5 = 6 then x = ?)</em></p>",
