      "subject": "गणित",
      "section": "2",
      "question": "<p><strong>[अधिकृत MSCE PUP 2026 Set A]</strong> एका संख्येच्या तिपटीत त्या संख्येची दुप्पट मिळवल्यास 85 येतात, तर ती संख्या कोणती?<br><em>(If thrice a certain number is added to twice the same number then it comes to 85 then which is that number?)</em></p>",
      "question_text": "<p><strong>[अधिकृत MSCE PUP 2026 Set A]</strong> एका संख्येच्या तिपटीत त्या संख्येची दुप्पट मिळवल्यास 85 येतात, तर ती संख्या कोणती?<br><em>(If thrice a certain number is added to twice the same number then it comes to 85 then which is that number?)</em></p>",
